        "subheading": "",
        "title": "<p>Our Story Began with Two Puppies Coming Home</p>",
        "heading_highlight_type": "circle",
        "highlight_color": "#d43747",
        "highlight_text_color": "#000000",
        "heading_size": 100,
        "content": "<p>At Koozi, we get that modern dog families need more than just functional pet accessories—they need solutions that blend seamlessly into their lives and homes. Our journey started with a personal challenge.<br/><br/>When we welcomed two dachshunds, Winston and Bailey, we quickly realised that the market was missing pet products that combined both function and style in a way that fit perfectly into a modern home, and specifically fit the needs of small to medium dogs.</p>",
