            "highlight_text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Frustrated with the lack of options, we set out to design something better. It began with a crate that doubles as a chic side table, and then a dog bed that truly meets the needs of smaller dogs. Each Koozi product is crafted with the same care and attention that's put into our  home, ensuring that every piece enhances living spaces, while serving a practical purpose.<br/><br/>Our mission is simple: to offer modern dog families stylish, functional solutions that make life better for both pets and their paw'rents. We’re dedicated to making your home and your dog’s daily experiences, beautiful and extraordinary.</p>",
